// Title: Important Windows Service Terminated Unexpectedly
// ID: 56abae0c-6212-4b97-adc0-0b559bb950c3
// Status: test
// Level: high
// Author: Nasreddine Bencherchali (Nextron Systems)
// Date: 2023-04-14
// Tags: attack.stealth
// Description: Detects important or interesting Windows services that got terminated unexpectedly.
// Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

((where(Provider_Name = "Service Control Manager") AND where(EventID = "7034")) AND ((where(param1 ICONTAINS "Message Queuing")) OR ((where(Binary ICONTAINS "4d0053004d005100") OR where(Binary ICONTAINS "6d0073006d007100")))))
